{
  "public_post": "Good news, villagers: we have received a safe flour batch and baked fresh loaves today. All co‑op bread is now safe to eat. Refunds for yesterday's sales have been processed. Please return to the co‑op for fresh, affordable bread (the farm stand is still twice the price). Thank you for your patience.",
  "coop_message": "Team, the new flour arrived and baking is complete. Verify all loaves pass the quality check, restock the display, and open sales at 8 am. Log today's sales and ensure any remaining refunds are finalized. Great work handling the crisis.",
  "anonymous_tip": "Co‑op bread is now safe and back on sale—support local bakers for fresh, affordable loaves.",
