{
  "public_post": "Good news: our new flour batch has passed safety checks; co‑op bread is back on sale today at the usual price. All previous loaves were destroyed and refunds issued. If you felt ill from earlier bread, please visit the clinic; otherwise, we welcome you back for fresh, safe loaves.",
